<div class="policy-page-container">
  
  <!-- HERO BANNER -->
  <div class="policy-hero">
    <div class="policy-hero-content">
      <span class="policy-subtitle">Returns & Refunds</span>
      <h1 class="policy-title">Refund Policy</h1>
      <p class="policy-lead">Understand our guidelines regarding order cancellations, returns, exchanges, and refund processing.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- POLICY CONTENT -->
  <div class="policy-content-section">
    <div class="policy-card">
      
      <div class="policy-intro">
        <p>At <strong>Delisha Karigari</strong>, we take pride in the quality and craftsmanship of our handmade products. Because each item is carefully handcrafted by local artisans, we want you to be absolutely delighted with your purchase. Please read our policy below regarding refunds, returns, and cancellations.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="policy-block">
        <h2 class="policy-heading">1. Cancellations</h2>
        <p>We accept order cancellations within a limited window before dispatch:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Cancellation Window:</strong> You can cancel your order within <strong>12 hours</strong> of placing it.</li>
          <li>To request a cancellation, please email us at <a href="mailto:support@delishakarigari.com" class="policy-link">support@delishakarigari.com</a> or message us on WhatsApp at <strong>+91 98765 43210</strong> with your Order Number.</li>
          <li>Once an order has been dispatched from our workshop, it cannot be cancelled.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="policy-block">
        <h2 class="policy-heading">2. Returns & Exchanges</h2>
        <p>We offer returns and exchanges on eligible, non-customized items within <strong>7 days</strong> of delivery:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Eligible Items:</strong> Standard, non-personalized wall decor, standard Rakhi & Lumba, and general gifts.</li>
          <li><strong>Condition:</strong> Items must be returned in their original condition, unused, undamaged, and in their original packaging with all tags attached.</li>
          <li><strong>Non-Returnable Items:</strong> Customized or personalized orders (such as custom Bandhanwars with custom family names or specific dimensions) are handcrafted specifically for you and are **not eligible for returns or exchanges** unless they arrive damaged.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="policy-block">
        <h2 class="policy-heading">3. Damaged, Defective, or Incorrect Items</h2>
        <p>If you receive an item that is damaged during transit, defective, or incorrect, we will issue a **free replacement** or a **full refund**:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Mandatory Requirement:</strong> You must record a **continuous, unedited unboxing video** starting from opening the outer courier packaging to inspecting the item.</li>
          <li><strong>Report Window:</strong> Contact us and send the unboxing video/photos within <strong>24 hours</strong> of delivery at <a href="mailto:support@delishakarigari.com" class="policy-link">support@delishakarigari.com</a>.</li>
          <li>Once verified, we will arrange for a reverse pickup of the damaged product and ship a replacement or initiate a refund at no extra cost to you.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="policy-block">
        <h2 class="policy-heading">4. Return Process</h2>
        <p>If your item meets the eligibility criteria and you wish to return or exchange it:</p>
        <ol>
          <li>Send a return request email to <a href="mailto:support@delishakarigari.com" class="policy-link">support@delishakarigari.com</a> stating your Order Number and reason for return.</li>
          <li><strong>Return Shipping:</strong> For standard returns/exchanges, the customer is responsible for shipping the item back to our workshop in Jaipur. Return shipping charges are non-refundable.</li>
          <li>We recommend using a reliable trackable shipping service. We are not responsible for returned packages lost in transit.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div class="policy-block">
        <h2 class="policy-heading">5. Refund Processing</h2>
        <p>Once we receive and inspect your returned item, we will notify you of the approval or rejection of your refund:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Approved Refunds:</strong> The amount (excluding COD charges and original shipping fees, if any) will be credited to your original payment method within <strong>5 to 7 business days</strong>.</li>
          <li><strong>COD Orders:</strong> For Cash on Delivery orders, we will request your bank details or UPI ID to transfer the refund amount directly.</li>
          <li><strong>Store Credit Option:</strong> You can also choose to receive store credit (gift card) which is issued instantly and has no expiry date.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

</div>

